00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:48.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, this is interesting.
In a "Closer Look,"

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:51.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
we had a joke
about a 1986 Camaro,

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:53.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
