a 1986 Camaro.

00:00:56.423 --> 00:00:57.590 line:92%
And then during rehearsals

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:00.760 align:start size:94% position:6%
someone in the crew said
that's not a Camaro.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.862 line:92%
That's a Pontiac Trans Am.

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:05.865
And so we called the photo
service back and they said

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:08.435 align:start size:94% position:6%
no, that's definitely --
definitely a Camaro.

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:09.402 line:92%
So then we put it in the show,

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:12.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
and a bunch of you said
that is a Pontiac Trans Am

00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:14.207 size:78% position:39% line:92%
So, long story short,

00:01:14.207 --> 00:01:18.845 size:84% position:42%
