Giuliani Photo Service.

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:21.281 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:27.420 align:start size:94% position:6%
Last night,
we had a joke about Nic Cage

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:30.857 align:start size:94% position:6%
where I said, as Nic Cage,
that I had --

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:35.695
