who put me up for adoption

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:39.032 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then we showed
the adoption papers.

00:01:39.032 --> 00:01:42.102 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it said "child's name
prior to adoption."

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:42.969 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It said "Nic Cage."

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:44.838 align:start size:94% position:6%
And someone said,
"Hey, man, you know better

00:01:44.838 --> 00:01:47.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
