isn't his real name."

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:49.476 line:92%
Because he's Nicolas Coppola

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:53.913
But I would like to point ou
that in this world we buil

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:58.118 line:92%
his dinosaur name is Nic Cage,

00:01:58.118 --> 00:02:01.488 align:start size:94% position:6%
then he was adopted
by the Coppolas,

00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:04.757 size:78% position:39%
