to his dinosaur name.

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:11.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
That transitions well
into dragons.

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:15.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is a correction that I go
based on a correction.

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:21.207
I corrected my pronunciation
of the J.R.R. Tolkien dragon

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:23.009 line:92%
And I know it's "Tol-keen.

00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:26.846
Just wanted to see how fas
you ran to your keyboards.

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:28.915 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.915 --> 00:02:31.084 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I said it was Smog,

00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:32.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
