of all those books,

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:57.844 line:92%
'cause it's, uh, the shortest.

00:02:57.844 --> 00:03:00.380 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:03.950 align:start size:94% position:6%
